<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:24 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">3 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Jăng thưq pe</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Jăng</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Jn</para>
  <para style="mt">3 Jăng</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Khơl draq atăq ka Gai-ut xung xiaq, adro đơu gô xung xiaq đom varơuq dik.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Ay xung xiaq, đom tôôy varơuq, gô apôôy chuk ka ay jah karoh e, pheq đnooy e phon xăk kalh paraat dang đaji phon phool hiel ay đong jah kôt kalh. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Vii gô thier ra hlah hlaak tuôôy khơl oh ay truh ji dơơp xanưk dong dik truh ay, tyauq đaji kach ay đong măn tawaak hooy đom varơuq dik. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Gô be e xuum hlah hlaak leq kôt iaq kaluh varơuq neq, nưq laa gô hnoq ik tameng đaneq koot xau ku gô đong tawaak hooy đom varơuq dik.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Ay xung xiaq, ay đong dưk dơơp đom xuum tuôq paq kê varơuq kajoq đơu ay hnoq ik dơơp ka khơl oh ay, pheq đnooy dơơp varơuq nưq ka khơl tamooy kadrơy, <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />laa khơl adro heq dơơp xanưk truh xuum xung xiaq ku ay kangưưr tayuup vah. Ay hnoq dơơp kach rơơt rol tuôôy jarooy oot dưk hooy tyauq kach taxưngq dii Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />bơyh oot heq vlôh hooy vii Yal nưq, tuôôy be nhonq thưq kajoq xing kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Lunưq haay duh pheq đoonq tiip khơl adro đanưq, xôq haay jêêk vlôh khơl adro kung dơơp varơuq ka varơuq dik.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Gô heq valơk taleq apok ka tayuup vah, bơh Đi-ô-trep, dro trôôch dưk ưk tôôy manih, leh 'yo nhonq 'wot. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Vii kakơq neq, atoh gô truh, gô hnoq tabông 'yo kaluh varơuq dơơp ku kơy nưq đơu kơy nưq đong dơơp tuôôy pahnhiq 'wot bơơn kaluh apok xơk tauq. Ji tuôôy măn koq hlah xuum dii kaluh varơuq nưq, kơy nưq be chiuq đoonq tiip khơl oh ay, yôôch kơy nưq kung klơl đơ khơl leq e xuum tiip jarooy ji pađuôôy oot vlôh klơlh tayuup vah.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Ay xung xiaq, te dơơp atôôlh varơuq xơk, đơu dayh dơơp atôôlh varơuq kaxay. Kơyq dơơp kaxay yôôych thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk, dro dơơp xơk yôôych koq hmưq hloq Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Đê-mê-triu jah apok xanưk kaxay xing tôôy manih ji xing aduq varơuq dik. Panưh kadrơy, 'wot kung dơơp xanưk đnoyq, ji ay xet đaneq apok xanưk ku 'wot laa dong dik.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Gô e 'ngưng varơuq xôq valơk ka ay, đơu gô leh trôôch xok phôôm ji chih xôq valơk ka ay. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Bơh gô trôôch meel tavơh ay, ji haay hnoq đnooy athêêk mot hyioh mot. <verse eid="3JN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Apôôy varơuq hrok hrol măn dii ay. Khơl 'wơyq kađneng vôôch hlơq ay. Xiin atăq apok vôôch hlơq khơl 'wơyq kađnư anơng tong dro muuyq.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>